.function main 0 16
STATE_NEW R0 0.4 0.2 0.0
STATE_NEW R1 0.8 -0.1 0.0
APPEND R0 R1 R2
MEASURE R2 probability R3
PRINT R3
MEASURE R2 distribution R4
PRINT R4
MEASURE R2 sample R5
PRINT R5
SAMPLE_STATE_DIST R2 R6
PRINT R6
ESTIMATE_MEASURE_PROBABILITY R2 R7 computational 100
PRINT R7
ESTIMATE_MEASURE_DISTRIBUTION R2 R8 computational 100
PRINT R8
MEASURE_BASIS R0 R9 computational probability
PRINT R9
RETURN R0
